{"ticker":"CNP","updated":"2026-10-23T22:47:32Z","profile":{"longName":"CenterPoint Energy, Inc.","shortName":"CenterPoint Energy, Inc (Holdin","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.centerpointenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":8794,"marketCap":27053641728,"trailingPE":24.301775,"forwardPE":19.66502,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.812229,"pegRatio":2.09,"targetMeanPrice":44.0,"targetHighPrice":49.0,"targetLowPrice":39.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.107,"earningsGrowth":0.233,"grossMargins":0.47027,"operatingMargins":0.24489,"profitMargins":0.11611,"totalRevenue":9619999744,"beta":0.459,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":45.26,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":36.37,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.33},"summary":"CenterPoint Energy, Inc. operates as a public utility holding company in the United States. The company operates through Electric; Natural Gas; and Corporate and Other segments. The Electric segment provides electric transmission and distribution services to electric customers and electric generation assets, as well as optimizes assets in the wholesale power market in Indiana Electric's service territory. The Natural Gas segment engages in the intrastate natural gas sales, and natural gas transportation and distribution for residential, commercial, and industrial customers in Indiana, Minnesota, Ohio, and Texas; permanent pipeline connections through interconnects with various interstate and intrastate pipeline companies; and provides home appliance maintenance and repair services to customers in Minnesota and home repair protection plans to natural gas customers in Indiana, Mississippi, Ohio, and Texas through a third party. As of December 31, 2025, it served approximately 2,859,313 metered customers; owned 355 substations with transformer capacity of 81,692 megavolt amperes; and owned and operated approximately 208 miles of intrastate pipeline in Louisiana and Texas. The company was founded in 1866 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","summary_zh":"CenterPoint Energy, Inc. 在美國以公用事業控股公司身分營運。該公司透過電力運作；天然氣;以及企業和其他部門。電力部門為電力客戶和發電資產提供輸電和配電服務，並優化印第安納電力服務領域批發電力市場的資產。天然氣部門為印第安納州、明尼蘇達州、俄亥俄州和德克薩斯州的住宅、商業和工業客戶提供州內天然氣銷售、天然氣運輸和配送；透過與各州際和州內管道公司互連的永久管道連接；並透過第三方為明尼蘇達州的客戶提供家電維護和維修服務，並為印第安納州、密西西比州、俄亥俄州和德克薩斯州的天然氣客戶提供家庭維修計劃。截至2025年12月31日，它為約2,859,313名計量客戶提供服務；擁有變電站355座，變壓器容量81692兆伏安；在路易斯安那州和德克薩斯州擁有並運營約 208 英里的州內管道。該公司成立於 1866 年，總部位於德克薩斯州休斯頓。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":37.81,"h":38.03,"l":37.67,"c":37.7,"v":5756000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":37.76,"h":37.87,"l":37.48,"c":37.7,"v":4053600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":37.74,"h":37.83,"l":37.52,"c":37.73,"v":3246800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":37.62,"h":37.73,"l":37.39,"c":37.48,"v":3720400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":37.48,"h":37.85,"l":37.45,"c":37.71,"v":4846900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":37.65,"h":38.16,"l":37.58,"c":37.94,"v":4304900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":37.88,"h":38.02,"l":37.39,"c":37.62,"v":4851900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":37.83,"h":37.88,"l":36.6,"c":37.46,"v":8438200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":37.67,"h":37.84,"l":37.42,"c":37.78,"v":5087100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":37.64,"h":37.74,"l":37.13,"c":37.32,"v":3969500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":37.27,"h":37.84,"l":37.25,"c":37.54,"v":4616400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":37.59,"h":37.86,"l":37.46,"c":37.79,"v":3530700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":37.88,"h":38.27,"l":37.67,"c":38.24,"v":4668100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":38.15,"h":38.63,"l":38.15,"c":38.24,"v":4280800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":38.34,"h":38.56,"l":38.22,"c":38.29,"v":3695700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":38.17,"h":38.49,"l":37.59,"c":37.65,"v":4280900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":37.86,"h":38.28,"l":37.73,"c":38.05,"v":4726300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":37.67,"h":38.35,"l":37.67,"c":38.07,"v":4597400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":38.18,"h":38.29,"l":37.87,"c":38.02,"v":6883400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":38.11,"h":38.4,"l":37.99,"c":38.17,"v":4002900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o